{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2021-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1633046400, "end_date": 1633651199, "month_true_total": 512, "quota": 9, "returned": 9, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:19:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "100700083", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974952835", "personaname": "VULGI", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197974952835/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 11536, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 710, "last_played": 1673550839, "avatar": "66efce1bebcf0f0c265bdef5997ac3142c94d973"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a great game to play with friends, exactly what you need to relax while having fun and if you want to go to higher difficulty levels a challenge as well.", "timestamp_created": 1633650468, "timestamp_updated": 1633650468, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100698796", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024724015", "personaname": "Kelder", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/beehm/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 2200, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1847, "last_played": 1634844659, "avatar": "8d4300f5f7174023e8ba7b6eef4333de00224e93"}, "language": "english", "review": "Throw horror out the door.  Guns go BRRT.  Just treat it as Gears of War:  Xenomorph Edition", "timestamp_created": 1633647744, "timestamp_updated": 1633647744, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100698702", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984584136", "personaname": "Kronk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/painttrain/", "num_games_owned": 248, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3233, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3130, "last_played": 1679715028, "avatar": "1f1bb04d15884799b3fb8a573c31081a8df0c4aa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pros:\n+Not a \"full price\" game($40)\n+Fun gameplay\n+Allows a lot of customization in \"builds\"\n+Audio design(music, sound effects, mood/tension)\n\nCons:\n-No one to play with\n-Incompetent developers\n\nThe \"Cons\" are not served justice as bullet points.  \n\n       This game feels like it was made by an AI; it's as though this program(synthetic) knew what makes a game fun to play, but didn't know what it meant to be a player in the game.  The lack of any sort of queuing options to reliably get you into a match became a major issue within a few days of launch, and was \"acknowledged\" by the \"developers\", but was not made a priority, as it should have been.  By the time \"Quick Play\" dropped, the game's population had dwindled to nothing, and there was no fanfare about the update(such as a sale, to \"soft relaunch\" the game)and bring in more players(MONEY).  Matches beyond the normal difficulty are nigh impossible to find, and the challenge is what drives the community in this genre.  Very big missed opportunity, but not impossible to reconcile if the devs make a big deal of a sale and/or free weekend.  \n\nEven with all the problems, I played it enough to justify the purchase price, in my opinion.  The staying power of a game like this comes from the challenge of higher difficulties(think Vermintide, Left for Dead, Deep Rock Galactic, etc), which were and are still impossible to queue because of how the game was released.  For now, it's uninstalled, but with the proper management, it can still be salvaged and become a great game.", "timestamp_created": 1633647550, "timestamp_updated": 1633647550, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.464684009552001953", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100698271", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985350912", "personaname": "UNBEROGEN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197985350912/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 7448, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1446, "last_played": 1760642817, "avatar": "ec56ab8a4e885a25877f3fea1e7f5153dff4d165"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm just here so they don't fine me.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1633646733, "timestamp_updated": 1633646733, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100695337", "author": {"steamid": "76561198346242205", "personaname": "crankyvermin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198346242205/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 23752, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 204, "playtime_at_review": 6999, "last_played": 1787771450, "avatar": "a87b6c18f07c1a1e7d7089a2f3d1ef8a7eaa6eb2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love this game, you can play with bots or people. Works for me.", "timestamp_created": 1633641524, "timestamp_updated": 1633641524, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_fu